1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,511
Patriot National's third quarter:
interest income more than doubled,

2
00:00:04,511 --> 00:00:08,140
but costs still ate ninety-four cents of
every revenue dollar.

3
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:13,829
Net interest income rose one hundred
fourteen percent to ten point seven
million dollars.

4
00:00:14,379 --> 00:00:19,856
The bank earned one point two
million, against a two point seven
million dollar loss a year ago.

5
00:00:20,406 --> 00:00:24,958
Its efficiency ratio of ninety-four
percent was the highest of four
peers.

6
00:00:25,508 --> 00:00:31,015
Other income of three point one
million made up nearly a fifth of
revenue, and may not repeat.

7
00:00:31,565 --> 00:00:37,586
Professional fees jumped four point
one million dollars, the main reason
costs rose fifty-two percent.

8
00:00:38,136 --> 00:00:41,710
The question now is how much of
that other income comes back.

